@startuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"

' 反例：说谎的继承
class File {
  +read() : string
  +write(data : string)
}
class ReadOnlyFile extends File {
  +write(data : string)
}
note right of ReadOnlyFile : write() 抛异常\n"我是 File" 是个谎言\n调用者处处要防着它

' 正例：诚实的抽象
interface Readable {
  +read() : string
}
interface Writable {
  +write(data : string)
}
class ReadOnlyFile2 implements Readable
class ReadWriteFile implements Readable
class ReadWriteFile implements Writable
note right of ReadWriteFile : 子类型真能\n替换父类型\n调用者不用提心吊胆
@enduml
